  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">About Us<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Humansoff.com<\/strong> is an AI Automation company helping businesses automate sales, customer support, and operations using AI-powered systems. We work with startups, agencies, healthcare businesses, and service companies to help them grow faster with automation.<\/p>\n<h3>Role Overview<\/h3>\n<p>We're looking for motivated individuals who enjoy communicating with people and want hands-on experience in sales and business development. You'll be responsible for reaching out to potential clients, starting conversations, qualifying leads, and booking meetings for our team.<\/p>\n<h3>Key Responsibilities<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Reach out to potential clients via calls, email, LinkedIn, and other outreach channels.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Introduce our AI automation solutions in a professional manner.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Qualify leads and schedule meetings with interested prospects.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Maintain accurate outreach records in the CRM.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Follow the provided sales playbook, scripts, and SOPs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Collaborate with the sales team to improve outreach performance.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Who Can Apply<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Students, fresh graduates, or anyone interested in sales and business development.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Good spoken and written English.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong communication and interpersonal skills.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Self-motivated and eager to learn.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Basic knowledge of LinkedIn and Google Workspace is a plus.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>What You'll Get<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Comprehensive sales and cold outreach training.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Practical experience working with AI solutions and B2B sales.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Mentorship from experienced founders.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Letter of Recommendation (based on performance).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Certificate of Completion.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Performance-based incentives with growth opportunities.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Opportunity to transition into long-term roles based on performance.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Duration<\/h3>\n<p>Flexible | Remote<\/p>\n<p>If you're eager to build your sales skills, work with cutting-edge AI solutions, and grow in a fast-paced startup environment, we'd love to hear from you.<\/p>",
